<title>USA: Uniflex Inc Q1 April 30 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Uniflex Inc Q1 April 30 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>HICKSVILLE, N.Y. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						   4/30/97	  4/30/96</p>
<p> Net sales				   $9,257,000    $8,555,000</p>
<p> Net income				     305,000	 523,000</p>
<p> Net income per share			     .07	  .12(a)</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding  4,535,000     4,408,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income per share for the first quarter of 1996 has been adjusted to reflect three-for-two stock split paid as a stock dividend in October 1996.</p>
